            "review_title": "Review at Gio Bien Restaurant",
            "review_text": "mymy2006\nHanoi, Vietnam23 contributions\n0\nAll hype!!!\nOct 2016 • Family\nWe arrived at 10pm when most of seafood was ran out.\nSo the selection for dinner was poor and I don't complain.\nBut the staff's attitude is really annoying. They are not helpful & even express their obvious attitude \"I don't want serve\".\nIf I had travelled alone, I'd have walked away right away. But I travelled with my family and didn't want they get more tired after a long flight. So we endured their bad attitude.\nEverything on the internet is TOTALLY UNTRUE - MIND YOU. The food is also at average quality.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 26, 2016",
